QuestGuidance.Register("en",181,{
[5761]="700076B3\n1\tFind Nate\tNate may be found near the abandoned work-site to the east of Thornley's Work-site, before the graveyard and at the top of the boar-hollow. Kenton told you that Nate said he was going to test the sword on the workers to the east of Thornley's Work-site. If you can find Nate there, perhaps you can get Lofar's sword back.\n2\tBring the broken hilt to Kenton Thistleway\tKenton Thistleway can be found, working, at the southernmost section of Thornley's Work-site along the Greenway. You found the brigand Nate, who stole Lofar's blade. Unfortunately for him, the blade broke, and he was slain by one of the boars he sought to kill. You should speak to Kenton Thistleway and let him know that Nate will no longer trouble his family.\n3\tBring the broken hilt to Lofar Ironband\tLofar Ironband can be found at the stone house just north of the Bree Cross-roads where Chief Watcher Grimbriar has set up his post. You found Nate dead and Lofar's sword broken. Now Kenton Thistleway is afraid that the brigand Blake will come looking for his sword and will harm Kenton's family when he finds that it does not exist. Kenton has asked you to convince Lofar Ironband to forge another that he can use to appease Blake.\n",
[5762]="70055A57\n1\tComplete 'Leave No One Behind'\t\n2\tTalk to Faeron\tFaeron and Rhadrog are stationed in the Stargazer's Spire in Minas Morgul. You should report to Faeron.\n3\tTalk to Rhadrog\tRhadrog can be found in the Stargazer's Spire. You should talk to Rhadrog.\n4\tComplete Ghashan-kútot, the Halls of Black Lore\tComplete Ghashan-kútot, the Halls of Black Lore on any difficulty mode. You may enter this instance by using the Instance Join panel.\n5\tTalk to Dolguzigir\tYou have defeated Dolguzigir, and been granted an opportunity to take one tome from the Halls of Black Lore. You should ask Dolguzigir for the Great Plague recipe.\n6\tTalk to Faeron in the Stargazer's Spire\tYou have completed your mission and acquired the plague recipe. You should talk to Faeron.\n",
[5763]="70055918\n1\tTalk to Faeron\tFaeron is standing by inside the Halls of Black Lore. Speak to him when you are ready to begin.\n2\tDefeat the Vision of Past Adventures\tDefeat the Vision of Past Adventures. If Rhadrog or Faeron will not answer the call of the Horn of the Rangers, try using the chat command /pet releaseall to dismiss them, and then re-summon them with the Horn.\n3\tDefeated the Vision of Fallen Foes\tDefeat the Vision of Fallen Foes. If Rhadrog or Faeron will not answer the call of the Horn of the Rangers, try using the chat command /pet releaseall to dismiss them, and then re-summon them with the Horn.\n4\tDefeat Dolguzigir, the Dark Archivist\tDefeat Dolguzigir, the Dark Archivist If Rhadrog or Faeron will not answer the call of the Horn of the Rangers, try using the chat command /pet releaseall to dismiss them, and then re-summon them with the Horn.\n",
[5764]="70055916\n1\tDefeat the Vision of Past Adventures\tDefeat the Vision of Past Adventures.\n2\tDefeat the Vision of Fallen Foes\tDefeat the Vision of Fallen Foes.\n3\tDefeat Dolguzigir, the Dark Archivist\t\n",
[5765]="70055919\n1\tDefeat the Vision of Past Adventures\tDefeat the Vision of Past Adventures.\n2\tDefeat the Vision of Fallen Foes\tDefeat the Vision of Fallen Foes.\n3\tDefeat Dolguzigir, the Dark Archivist\tDefeat Dolguzigir, the Dark Archivist.\n",
[5766]="70055917\n1\tDefeat the Vision of Past Adventures\tDefeat the Vision of Past Adventures.\n2\tDefeat the Vision of Fallen Foes\tDefeat the Vision of Fallen Foes.\n3\tDefeat Dolguzigir, the Dark Archivist\tDefeat Dolguzigir, the Dark Archivist.\n",
[5767]="7005A61A\n1\tSearch for clues\tThe fallen statue is located in Amdân. Look for clues near the broken statue.\n2\tSearch for clues\tThe wall is near the broken statue in Amdân. Look for more clues along the wall.\n3\tSearch for clues\tThe gap in the wall is in Amdân. Follow the trail of the thief.\n4\tDeliver the scrap to Thromur\tThromur can be found in Amdân. Talk to Thromur.\n",
[5768]="7003FEAD\n1\tTalk to Dírion\tDírion can be found in the village of Alagrant in western Blackroot Vale. Calennen has asked you to speak to the other hunters in Alagrant about Malthellam's warning.\n2\tTalk to Sarnir\tSarnir can be found in the village of Alagrant in western Blackroot Vale. Calennen has asked you to speak to the other hunters in Alagrant about Malthellam's warning.\n",
[5769]="70000156\n1\tBring bear pelts to Adelard Took\030Collect bear pelts (total: 5)\tBears can be found in the woods east of Tuckborough. Adelard believes the ghost of the Old Took is upset by the troubles darkening the Shire of late, especially the recent aggressiveness of the bears. He has asked you to bring him a few bear pelts to prove to the Old Took that all is well in hand.\n",
[5770]="70060722\n1\tFind the elderly couple\tThe road to Tornhad is in the western Angle. You should look for the elderly couple along the road to Tornhad.\n2\tTalk to the elderly couple\tWaltney and Garan Maythorn are located near Eitheldir. Elladan has asked you to see how fares the elderly couple headed to Tornhad.\n3\tDefeat Ost Waeren ravagers (total: 10)\tOst Waeren is near the road south of Eitheldir. Waltney Maythorn has asked you to investigate the ruins of Ost Waeren.\n4\tReturn to the elderly couple\tWaltney and Garan Maythorn are located near Ost Waeren. You should let Waltney and Garan know that the ravagers have been defeated.\n",
[5771]="700303B3\n1\tUse your pick-axe to dig for Iron at Ghâmpronk (total: 10)\tIron can be mined at Ghâmpronk. Waldeg asked you to venture across the river to Ghâmpronk and mine iron.\n2\tTalk to Waldeg\tWaldeg is at Snowbourn. Waldeg will be pleased to begin making weapons and armour with the iron from Ghâmpronk.\n",
[5772]="7002F35F\n1\tDefeat goblins and trolls at Ghâmpronk (total: 10)\tGoblins and trolls can be found at Ghâmpronk. Waldeg asked to venture to Ghâmpronk and defeat the goblins and trolls mining within.\n2\tTalk to Waldeg\tWaldeg is at Snowbourn. Waldeg will be pleased to hear the goblins are no longer mining at Ghâmpronk.\n",
[5773]="700494CB\n1\tDefeat Ghâsh-hai Devoted\tDevoted Ghâsh-hai can be found in Talath Úrui, near the Ghâshghurm. You should defeat any devoted Ghâsh-hai you encounter.\n2\tDefeat Ghâsh-hai Devoted (total: 10)\tDevoted Ghâsh-hai can be found in Talath Úrui, near the Ghâshghurm. You should defeat any devoted Ghâsh-hai you come across.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeated many devoted Ghâsh-hai in Talath Úrui.\n",
[5774]="70000FF0\n1\tSeek the Giants' Table in the Misty Mountains\tThe Giants' Table is south of the pass of Rakhâs-bizar, east of the guarded pass of Gabilazan.\n2\tFind the Giants' Table\tThe Giants' Table is south of the pass of Rakhâs-bizar, east of the guarded pass of Gabilazan.\n3\tYou found the Giants' Table, but the giants there attacked without warning. They have lost their respect for the old ways, and the Giants' Table is no longer a place of peaceful negotiation.\t\n",
[5775]="7000B955\n1\tExamine enormous footprints\tThere are likely other footprints near the first one you found, on the ridge above the western bank of the river in the southern area of Tâl Bruinen. You found a giant footprint in Tâl Bruinen, and should look for more.\n2\tExamine enormous footprints\tThere are likely other footprints near the others you found, on the ridge above the western bank of the river in the southern area of Tâl Bruinen. You found some giant footprints in Tâl Bruinen, and should look for more.\n3\tBring lost brooch to Candelleth\tCandelleth is at her encampment, Echad Candelleth, in Tâl Bruinen. You found the Elf-brooch in the footprint of a giant that must have come down from the mountains into Tâl Bruinen and should seek to return it to its owner. Perhaps Candelleth will know to whom it belongs.\n",
[5776]="70007843\n1\tDefeat Svalfang\tSvalfang's hut is north of Buckland, overlooking the Brandywine River. Amlan has asked you to drive the giant Svalfang from the land.\n2\tBring news of your deeds to Amlan\t\n",
[5777]="7005307E\n1\tDefeat stone-giants in the Gladdenmere (total: 15)\tStone-giants can be found on the northern edge of the Gladdenmere. You should defeat any stone-giants that you find in the Gladdenmere.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many stone-giants.\n",
[5778]="7003A6A8\n1\tCollect TBD Flower\030Collect TBD Sapling\030Collect TBD Plant\tTBD\n2\tPlant TBD Flower in the planter\030Plant TBD Sapling in the planter\030Plant TBD Plant in the planter\tTBD\n3\tReturn to Gifemund\tTBD\n",
[5779]="700385F8\n1\tTalk to Gifemund\tGifemund can be found in the ore-refinery, which is a wooden structure near the centre of town. Scurfa suggested that you speak with his new employer, Gifemund.\n2\tDefeat Dunlending trouble-makers (total: 8)\tDunlending trouble-makers can be found in lower Woodhurst. Gifemund asked you to deal with the Dunlending trouble-makers that have been hassling his mine.\n3\tTalk to Gifemund\tGifemund can be found in the ore-refinery near the centre of the city. Gifemund will be interested to hear your progress in dealing with the trouble-makers who threaten the safety of his mining operation nearest to Woodhurst.\n",
[5780]="7000D823\n1\tBring your gift mathoms to Greylond Bottomley\030Collect a gift mathom\tGreylond Bottomley is at the Mathom House in Michel Delving in the Shire. Greylond Bottomley has asked you to bring him any mathoms that you receive as gifts as you travel throughout the Shire.\n",
[5781]="700072F1\n1\tBring the bottle of wine to Dolengyl\tThe Elf-refuge of Duillond lies on the north road by the river. Bregedúr has asked you to deliver a bottle of last year's vintage to his friend Dolengyl.\n",
[5782]="700439FF\n1\tTalk to Rock\tBy completing this quest, you will receive a Gift-giver's Brands allowance.\n",
[5783]="7002AD31\n1\tDeliver the bracelet to Gail Catchpole in Combe\tGail Catchpole is in Combe. Roger Hazeltwig has asked you to deliver a lovely bracelet to Gail Catchpole, in the hopes that the gift will brighten her mood.\n",
[5784]="7002ADBC\n1\tDeliver the shield to Ormr in Frérin's Court\tOrmr is at Frérin's Court, near Thorin's Hall in Ered Luin. Dudo Chubb would like you to bring a shield to the Dwarf Ormr.\n",
[5785]="7002ADCF\n1\tDeliver the lucky goat's horn to Runulf in the Thorin's Hall inn\tRunulf is at his inn in the cellar of Thorin's Hall in Ered Luin. Ormr has tasked you with taking a lucky goat's horn to Runulf, the innkeeper in Thorin's Hall.\n",
[5786]="7002ADA4\n1\tDeliver the hammer to Dudo Chubb in Hobbiton\tDudo Chubb is in Hobbiton in the Shire. Esmerelda Burrows would like you to deliver a gift to her friend Dudo Chubb.\n",
[5787]="7002AE08\n1\tDeliver the festival ale to Roger Hazeltwig near the Boar-fountain in Bree\tRoger Hazeltwig is near the Boar-fountain in Bree. Runulf has requested that you take a pint of his special brew of ale to Roger Hazeltwig.\n",
[5788]="7002AD3F\n1\tDeliver the pastries to Constable Underhill in Combe\tConstable Underhill is outside the training hall in Combe. Gail Catchpole would like you to bring her delicious pastries to Constable Underhill.\n",
[5789]="7002AD8D\n1\tDeliver the wood carving to Esmerelda Burrows in Michel Delving\tEsmerelda Burrows is at The Bird and Baby Inn in Michel Delving in the Shire. Constable Underhill has tasked you with bringing a small, wooden carving to his friend Esmerelda Burrows in Michel Delving.\n",
[5790]="70028CAC\n1\tDefeat Orcs (total: 8)\tOrcs can be found near the bases of many of the hills east of Innoth's camp. Innoth has asked you to find the Orcs in the Isendale and drive them back into their caves.\n2\tTalk to Innoth near the Isen\tInnoth is at his camp near the Isen. You should inform Innoth that the Orcs have been driven back into their caves.\n",
[5791]="700571C4\n1\tTalk to Agátur in Limlók\tAgátur can be found in Limlók. You should talk to Agátur.\n2\tGather Warg pelts (total: 8)\tWargs can be found in the Floodfells. You should gather pelts from Wargs in the Floodfells.\n3\tPresent the pelts to Runerik Knotbeard\tRunerik Knotbeard can be found in Limlók. You should present the Warg pelts to Runerik Knotbeard.\n4\tTalk to Agátur in Limlók\tAgátur can be found in Limlók. You should talk to Agátur.\n",
[5792]="700375C6\n1\tTalk to Reeve Fríthild\tReeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke, west of Fríthild's house. You should return to Reeve Fríthild and let her know of her son's request.\n2\tSuitable trophies might be found upon fallen enemies. Fríthbert asked that you bring trophies from your forays to him and Edhild, and Reeve Fríthild has approved.\t\n3\tBring the armour and sword to Fríthbert\030Bring the short sword and shield to Edhild\tFríthbert and Edhild are at Fríthild's house, east of the Mead Hall of Stoke. You should bring the trophies you collected to Fríthbert and Edhild.\n",
})
